#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:385
msgid "3. Check it worked"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:386
msgid "The versioned binary matters: plain `php` on the command line can be a different PHP than the site runs. Then press Re-check on this page - that is the authoritative test, because it asks the exact PHP process serving this site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:401
msgid "tideways_xhprof has never been on PECL, so it is built from source. It is free and open source (Apache 2.0) and sends nothing anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:406
