#. translators: %s: detected operating system
#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:433
#, php-format
msgid "The extension is compiled on this server, so it needs the PHP development headers. Detected: %s."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:441
msgid "2. Build and install"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:447
msgid "2. Install the extension"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:448
msgid "Excimer is free and open source (Apache 2.0) and sends nothing anywhere - a local extension, not a service. PECL itself is deprecated and excimer 1.2.6 is the last version published there, but on this system it is still the shortest working path (the maintained successor is PIE: pie install wikimedia/excimer). If this step fails with \"shtool ... does not exist or is not executable\", your server mounts /tmp with noexec (a common hardening default) - temporarily allow execution there for the build, then restore it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-tools.php:459
